sig
  bpm 130
  system 22shruti western
  scale F chromatic

arr
  main 32 |ifc

tracks
  1 drone + drums |bmz
    type audio
    strip tivraStrip
  2 midi |dgx
    type midi
    plugin Jup-8 V4
    fx tivraDistortion
    strip tivraStrip
  4 Audio |cre
    type audio
    fx tivraVibeFX
    strip tivraStrip

returns
  0 Hall |rnq
  1 Plate |raj
  2 Delay |rdw
  3 Color |rep

sec main
